            },
            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "nicole"
            },
            "reviewBody": "These are so easy and quick. I didn't have honey so substituted light corn syrup. Added only about 1/3 cup of it, not 1/2 cup. After making it put it in the freezer for about 15 minutes to chill fast. Then take it out to cut and serve. Yummy!!",
            "datePublished": "2015-05-04T19:20:58.080Z"
          },
