            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "sueb"
            },
            "reviewBody": "Easy to make! I had to make these on the stove top, so was thankful for the description of \"until bubbly\" when cooking the bottom layer. I subbed cinnamon chips for the chocolate chips. These disappeared quickly. Great recipe!",
            "datePublished": "2011-03-13T20:00:29.707Z"
