              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Erinbrideau"
            },
            "reviewBody": "I've been looking for this recipe for 2 years as my grandma used to make it. So delicious, chewy, not too sweet but ridiculously addictive. I do it on the stove though not the microwave as the microwave changes the flavour a bit.",
