            },
            "reviewBody": "Very tasty. I followed the recipe but put the frosting on directly after the mix was set in the dish. Came out fine. Cut the sections in bite sizes so it doesn't hit too sweet all in one bite. You'll soon crave for another bite.",
            "datePublished": "2011-04-06T13:48:37.717Z"
